message: 'To cite package "processLM" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'processLM: Process lm Objects'
version: 0.0.11
abstract: 'Preprocessing helper functions for the ''lm'' object: sample moments, standardized
  and selectively standardized partial regression slopes, R-squared and adjusted R-squared,
  semipartial and partial correlations, Cohen''s f-squared, differences of slopes,
  and Monte Carlo draws of the model-implied covariance matrices. The internal functions
  have no input checks and are copied by other projects.'
